<title>NEW ZEALAND: Glenealy buys a Fletcher forest for NZ$210 mln.</title>
<headline>Glenealy buys a Fletcher forest for NZ$210 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glenealy Plantations Bhd said on Friday it had bought Fletcher Forest Ltd's Hikurangi Forest on the East Coast of the North Island for NZ$210 million.</p>
</text>
